OL,3,GNEWSATrust launches 'first-of-its-kind'
OL,4,Anature survey
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wildlife trust has said it has
OL,7,Flaunched a first-of-its-kind survey to
OL,8,Fhelp find out how people feel about
OL,9,Fnature and guide future conservation
OL,10,Fefforts.
OL,12,FThe Suffolk Wildlife Trust (SWT), in
OL,13,Fcollaboration with the University of
OL,14,FSuffolk, has brought out the Great
OL,15,FSuffolk Nature Survey, which quizzes
OL,16,Fparticipants on the county's
OL,17,F"struggling" wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
