OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrust launches 'first-of-its-kind'
OL,4,Anature survey
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt asks about their experiences with
OL,7,Flocal wildlife, how they get involved
OL,8,Fwith local nature, and their attitudes
OL,9,Ftowards conservation, climate change
OL,10,Fand environmental projects.
OL,12,FThe short survey comes weeks after a
OL,13,Fdevastating wildfire at Dunwich Heath
OL,14,Fand nearby RSPB Minsmere destroyed
OL,15,Fvital wildlife habitats, which could
OL,16,Ftake years to recover.
